direct assignments to arrays not permitted
--
A mem-initializer `data{}' for an array of arrays assigned each element's
zero value to the element, an array ("direct assignments to arrays not
permitted").  The MSVC STL's _Digit_pair_table (<xutility>) has
`_Elem _Data[100][2]' and `: _Data{}'.
